OL,3,GNEWSASign error directs drivers to city
OL,4,A70 miles away
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere was confusion in a Cornish town
OL,7,Fwhen a new road sign appeared, with
OL,8,Fdirections to a city marina 70 miles
OL,9,F(112.6km) away and in a different
OL,10,Fcounty.
OL,12,FThe new 'Plymouth Marina' brown tourist
OL,13,Fsign appeared in Falmouth on Tuesday,
OL,14,Fprinted beside the words, 'The
OL,15,FGreenbank Hotel' - which is in
OL,16,FFalmouth.
OL,18,FA spokesperson for Cornwall Council
OL,19,Fsaid the sign was taken down on
OL,20,FThursday and would be replaced.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
