OL,3,GNEWSASign error directs drivers to city
OL,4,A70 miles away
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey said: "While Plymouth Marina is
OL,7,Fworthy of a tourist sign in the right
OL,8,Flocation, this particular sign was not
OL,9,Fmade to our specification."
